{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9: A Language Learning Management Sim",
    "steam_appid": 2236490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Become a caf\u00e9 owner in a foreign country and learn a new language as you grow your business! Open shop in 1 of the 7 cities: Mexico City, Paris, Milan, Berlin, Los Angeles, Shanghai, Seoul, and Kyoto to learn Spanish, French, Italian, German, English, Chinese (Mandarin), Korean, and Japanese!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/96936c3ee247b53aab132d2c15d4dc43.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/96936c3ee247b53aab132d2c15d4dc43.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/96936c3ee247b53aab132d2c15d4dc43.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you greet customers and serve them the drinks and food items they desire, you pick up authentic language in the most genuine in immersive context. Click on any word to display its meaning and you can toggle the sound and words of the customers\u2019 orders to customize the learning experience to fit your needs. No more boring phrases that you will never use! With Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9, you will be able to order in a coffee shop on your travel in a foreign language in no time, all while having great fun!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/e60b3a091d929b4f391be856bf4c4cd3.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/e60b3a091d929b4f391be856bf4c4cd3.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/e60b3a091d929b4f391be856bf4c4cd3.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Learning a language in the country it\u2019s spoken is the best, because you get instant feedback whenever you use the language. But not everyone can do that. But now, with Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9, you can get instant feedback right in your living room and experience the fun and joy of experimenting to figure out the meaning of sentences and phrase via the response from your customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/585cc8b2c25c47e744bfd5a048fb242f.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/585cc8b2c25c47e744bfd5a048fb242f.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/585cc8b2c25c47e744bfd5a048fb242f.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you perfect your language skills, you can grow your coffee shop by upgrading the equipment and the menu using the hard-earned coins! New equipment opens the options of more advanced ingredients, which in turn unlock new items customers can order that makes you more money! Each country also has its unique items so you will feel that you are working in a real coffee shop there with the added cultural authenticity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/405c3758f2ae0e50777ea7958e920f97.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/405c3758f2ae0e50777ea7958e920f97.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/405c3758f2ae0e50777ea7958e920f97.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What\u2019s the fun in playing a game and learning a language without being able to compete against your friends and the community? The leaderboard function lets you see the top Caf\u00e9 owners in each language at any given time. Top the chart and brag to your friends in the language you just learned!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/790bfe5c38d522335270a7bb8172a04f.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/790bfe5c38d522335270a7bb8172a04f.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/790bfe5c38d522335270a7bb8172a04f.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9 is currently in active development, you can influence what we build next by joining our Discord! Interact with other language learners and give us direct feedback on how the game plays and what you want to see built next.<br><br>Join our growing community of language learners today and get Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9 now on Steam Early Access. The world of endless possibilities awaits!",
    "about_the_game": "Become a caf\u00e9 owner in a foreign country and learn a new language as you grow your business! Open shop in 1 of the 7 cities: Mexico City, Paris, Milan, Berlin, Los Angeles, Shanghai, Seoul, and Kyoto to learn Spanish, French, Italian, German, English, Chinese (Mandarin), Korean, and Japanese!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/96936c3ee247b53aab132d2c15d4dc43.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/96936c3ee247b53aab132d2c15d4dc43.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/96936c3ee247b53aab132d2c15d4dc43.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you greet customers and serve them the drinks and food items they desire, you pick up authentic language in the most genuine in immersive context. Click on any word to display its meaning and you can toggle the sound and words of the customers\u2019 orders to customize the learning experience to fit your needs. No more boring phrases that you will never use! With Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9, you will be able to order in a coffee shop on your travel in a foreign language in no time, all while having great fun!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/e60b3a091d929b4f391be856bf4c4cd3.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/e60b3a091d929b4f391be856bf4c4cd3.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/e60b3a091d929b4f391be856bf4c4cd3.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Learning a language in the country it\u2019s spoken is the best, because you get instant feedback whenever you use the language. But not everyone can do that. But now, with Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9, you can get instant feedback right in your living room and experience the fun and joy of experimenting to figure out the meaning of sentences and phrase via the response from your customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/585cc8b2c25c47e744bfd5a048fb242f.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/585cc8b2c25c47e744bfd5a048fb242f.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/585cc8b2c25c47e744bfd5a048fb242f.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you perfect your language skills, you can grow your coffee shop by upgrading the equipment and the menu using the hard-earned coins! New equipment opens the options of more advanced ingredients, which in turn unlock new items customers can order that makes you more money! Each country also has its unique items so you will feel that you are working in a real coffee shop there with the added cultural authenticity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/405c3758f2ae0e50777ea7958e920f97.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/405c3758f2ae0e50777ea7958e920f97.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/405c3758f2ae0e50777ea7958e920f97.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What\u2019s the fun in playing a game and learning a language without being able to compete against your friends and the community? The leaderboard function lets you see the top Caf\u00e9 owners in each language at any given time. Top the chart and brag to your friends in the language you just learned!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/790bfe5c38d522335270a7bb8172a04f.poster.avif?t=1752277140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/790bfe5c38d522335270a7bb8172a04f.webm?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236490/extras/790bfe5c38d522335270a7bb8172a04f.mp4?t=1752277140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9 is currently in active development, you can influence what we build next by joining our Discord! Interact with other language learners and give us direct feedback on how the game plays and what you want to see built next.<br><br>Join our growing community of language learners today and get Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9 now on Steam Early Access. The world of endless possibilities awaits!",
    "short_description": "Lost Abroad Caf\u00e9: a language learning game that puts you in the role of a virtual caf\u00e9 owner in another country. Learn and use your new language to serve your customers and grow your business. Try it now on Steam Early Access!",
